    description: "Found by the 2026-11-07 docstring staleness audit (dev 4f2feb451b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11072026/review, verify and blind). Corpus impact not measured. _DIRECTIVE_RE (blade.py:66) requires \\s*\\) right after the first quoted argument, so @yield('title', 'Default'), @component('alert', [...]) and @extends('layouts.app', [...]) emit nothing (no extends edge). The unrecorded component's @endcomponent then pops the outer component (blade.py:108-113), so later blocks get the wrong stable_id scope. The docstring means to exclude only the inline two-argument @section. r26, v10, b01."  # a715
